                      "attributes": {
                        "imageInfos": "",
                        "richTextValue": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0b2a4a;background:#f3f7fc;\">\n<div style=\"background:#0b2a4a;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:12px 16px;font-size:14px;\">Seat and baggage questions? Our assistant is online 24/7 &middot; Use the chat button at the bottom right</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;padding:20px 40px;background:#f3f7fc;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe5f1;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#1f7ae0;\">ASCEND <span style=\"color:#e8672a;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.04em;\">air</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><a href=\"#how\" style=\"border:1.5px solid #0b2a4a;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 20px;color:#0b2a4a;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">How it works</a><a href=\"#policies\" style=\"border:1.5px solid #0b2a4a;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 20px;color:#0b2a4a;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">Policies</a></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:72px 40px 64px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"color:#e8672a;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;\">Seat assistant</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:52px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:700;max-width:640px;\">Your seat, sorted in one conversation.</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a5b70;max-width:620px;\">Check your booking, see your seat, cabin and fare, and change your seat in minutes. Our Agentforce assistant handles it, and a colleague steps in whenever you need a person.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span style=\"background:#1f7ae0;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:14px 28px;font-weight:700;\">Chat with our assistant</span><a href=\"#how\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5f1;border-radius:999px;padding:14px 28px;font-weight:700;color:#0b2a4a;text-decoration:none;\">See how it works</a></div>\n<div style=\"color:#4a5b70;font-size:15px;\">Replies in under a minute &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; A colleague is one message away</div></div>\n<div id=\"how\" style=\"padding:56px 40px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-size:32px;\">Seat changes in three steps.</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5f1;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;\">\n<div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:#0b2a4a;color:#fff;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px;\">1</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;color:#0b2a4a;\">Verify in seconds</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#4a5b70;line-height:1.55;\">Share your booking reference and last name. Nothing is shown until both match.</p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5f1;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;\">\n<div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:#0b2a4a;color:#fff;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px;\">2</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;color:#0b2a4a;\">See your flight</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#4a5b70;line-height:1.55;\">We show your flight, seat, cabin and fare, so you know what can change.</p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5f1;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;\">\n<div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:#0b2a4a;color:#fff;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:14px;\">3</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;color:#0b2a4a;\">Change your seat</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#4a5b70;line-height:1.55;\">Pick a free seat that your fare allows. Need something more? We hand you to a colleague.</p></div>\n</div></div>\n<div id=\"policies\" style=\"padding:56px 40px 72px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-size:32px;\">Know before you go.</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5f1;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;\">\n<div style=\"color:#e8672a;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;\">Seats</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;color:#0b2a4a;\">Seat selection</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#4a5b70;line-height:1.55;\">Standard seats cost INR 200 to 1,700 on domestic and INR 200 to 2,000 on international flights. Stretch seats are complimentary.</p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5f1;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;\">\n<div style=\"color:#e8672a;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;\">Fares</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;color:#0b2a4a;\">Fare rules</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#4a5b70;line-height:1.55;\">What your fare allows for changes, cancellations and refunds, explained in plain language.</p></div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5f1;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;\">\n<div style=\"color:#e8672a;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;\">Baggage</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;color:#0b2a4a;\">Baggage allowance</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:#4a5b70;line-height:1.55;\">Cabin and checked baggage limits by fare, with extra-baggage options.</p></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"background:#0b2a4a;color:#c9d8ea;padding:32px 40px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;\">Fly higher, together. &copy; 2026 Ascend Air. Demo site &mdash; all data is fictional.</div>\n</div>"
